<title>POLAND: SOCCER-POLAND AND GEORGIA DRAW 2-2 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-POLAND AND GEORGIA DRAW 2-2 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>WODZISLAW, Poland 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland and Georgia</p>
<p>drew 2-2 (halftime 1-0) in a European under-21 soccer</p>
<p>championship group two qualifier on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Poland - Daniel Dubicki 42, Miroslaw Szymkowiak 82</p>
<p>Georgia - Mikhail Ashvetia 68, 80</p>
<p>Attendance: 3,000</p>
<p>    Standings	 P  W  D  L  F   A PTS </p>
<p> England		6  3  3  0  5   1  12</p>
<p> Italy		  6  3  2  1 17   3  11</p>
<p> Poland		 6  0  5  1  6   8   5</p>
<p> Georgia		5  1  2  2  3   9   5</p>
<p> Moldova		5  1  0  4  3  13   3</p>
</text>
